title: Bringing a remote branch to local from the picker shows the branch as the current one at once, and git is on it when the switch is done (same clicks as branch-picker-remotes, with a picture right after)
folders: git-remote-branches, rust-small
limit: 60
expect-file: git-remote-branches/.git/HEAD :: ref: refs/heads/fix/c
forbid-log: WARN.*script

wait 3500
left files
wait 1000
ui click 303 120
wait 2000
mark a-picker
wait 800
ui click 400 429
wait 200
mark b-right-after-the-click
wait 400
wait 2500
mark c-done
wait 450
quit
